aced graph’s snap-to-origin branch.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"title":"Interaction_DragView"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityRotor(_:entries:entryID:entryLabel:)-4mudm":{"title":"accessibilityRotor(_:entries:entryID:entryLabel:)","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityRotor","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntryModel","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ID","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"entries","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntryModel","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"entryID","kind":"externalPara